Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:28:23 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Rooms: a real GBA plays its cartridge's team, nothing is
 submitted

With a GB-Link in JOY Bus mode the cartridge is the team, so joining a room no longer sends one,
and Submit Team says so. The fallback reads the trainer and party off the cartridge (the partial
Cart Doctor read) and sends them as a loaded-in team for a seat the other machines run themselves.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01764cASb9aVVk2m6JupRMj5
